# Real per-machine overrides, including any hmac_key_hex/slave_hmac_key_hex
# signing key of a self-built image (the tool carries no default key, so a
# key written here must never be committed). Only urtc_config.json.example -
# a placeholder, never real key material - is meant to be tracked.
